  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establish links between learning processes, humanitarian policy and field practice; Improve systemwide fora for active learning and the exchange of experiences and ideas; Work to improve the quality and utilisation of evaluations within the network and throughout the humanitarian system; Expand its global reach and engagement in order to better promote humanitarian learning</narrative>
